  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "You have to compete with me for the final test.",
      "If you win, I will recognize that your skill have ",
      "been matured enough. After that I will teach ",
      "you the next skill set.",
      "The fight part of this challenge is to have the ",
      "Royal Amulet. We will battle in a secret place in ",
      "the Kingdom where general fighting is forbidden.",
      "Only a person with Royal Amulet can be allowed ",
      "to enter at there.  ",
      "Unfortunately, you don't have Royal Amulet.",
      "Fortunately, I heard a rumor some warriors have",
      "got Royal Amulet already. I can hint that ",
      "a special monster has Royal Amulet. ",
      "So, hunt the monsters until you get one.",
      "[Job Quest 3th]",
      "Find Royal Amulet."
    ]
  },
